omepage", "Industries served: plastics industry, injection molding, extrusion, recycling -> homepage", "Differentiators: wide range of equipment, expert guidance, quality and reliability partnerships -> homepage"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "APM is a manufacturers representative for plastics processing equipment.", "founded_year": "1983", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='arizona-plastics-machinery' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Ark Electrical LLC is a family-owned, faith-based electrical contracting company based in Cedar Crest, New Mexico, in the East Mountains region. The business was founded in 2019 by Master Electrician Juan Fernandez, who launched the company after eleven years of hands-on experience in the trade with a mission to bring faith-based honesty, reliability, and quality electrical services to his neighbors.

The company provides full-service residential and commercial electrical work, including new construction, remodels, smart-home conversions, service upgrades, panel replacements, backup generator installation, EV charger installation, and general electrical repairs. Operating with a small team that includes a senior electrical specialist and an apprentice, Ark Electrical emphasizes quality craftsmanship, upfront flat-rate pricing, and a "do it once and do it right" approach on every job.

Ark Electrical serves homeowners and businesses throughout Sandia Park, Cedar Crest, Tijeras, Edgewood, and the greater Albuquerque area. Its residential clients rely on the firm for everything from improving the safety of older electrical systems to integrating modern smart-home technology, while commercial customers engage the company for new builds and remodel projects.

Fernandez started Ark Electrical to combine his trade expertise with values rooted in faith, integrity, honesty, commitment, and respect. The company states that it stands behind its work, prioritizes clear communication, and aims to build lasting relationships with the families and communities it serves.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["New construction electrical", "Remodel electrical", "Smart home conversions", "Service upgrades", "Panel upgrades", "Backup generator installation", "EV charger installation", "Electrical repairs", "Manufactured home electrical services", "Troubleshooting and NEC compliance", "Permitting and code compliance", "Quality assurance"], "industries": ["Residential construction", "Commercial construction", "Manufactured housing", "Smart home technology", "Electrical repair and maintenance"], "materials": ["Electrical wiring", "Electrical panels", "Smart home devices", "EV chargers", "Backup generators"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Faith-based honesty and reliability as founding principles", "Upfront flat-rate pricing on all services", "Licensed, bonded, and insured for client protection", "Personable, relationship-focused approach", "\"Do it once and do it right\" workmanship motto"], "facts_used": ["Family-owned, faith-based electrical contracting company -> /", "Founded by Master Electrician Juan Fernandez in 2019 -> /about-us", "Located in Cedar Crest, New Mexico -> db", "Services: new construction, remodels, smart home conversions, upgrades, repairs -> /services", "Serves Sandia Park, Cedar Crest, Tijeras, Edgewood, greater Albuquerque area -> /about-us", "Team includes Juan Fernandez (Owner), Shawn Hoskinson (Senior Electrical Specialist), Carter Paas (Apprentice Field Specialist) -> /about-us", "Licensed, bonded, and insured -> /about-us", "Flat-rate pricing -> /about-us", "Faith-based honesty, reliability, quality -> /about-us"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We are a family owned, faith based, full-service residential and commercial electrical contracting company.", "founded_year": "2019", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='ark-electrical-llc' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
