UPDATE companies SET description='Artemis Plastics operates from Ocala, Florida, where it was established in 2014 after Apollo Renal Therapeutics acquired an existing plastic injection molding plant. The business runs as a contract manufacturer focused on injection-molded plastic components and is led by CEO Gary Mishkin.

