UPDATE companies SET description='Artisan Chef Manufacturing Co. operates from Lawrence, Massachusetts, with an additional production facility in Salem, New Hampshire. The company was founded by Joe Faro, a serial food entrepreneur and celebrated Boston restaurateur, though the exact founding year is not publicly disclosed.

