UPDATE companies SET description='Ascend Medical LLC was established in 2014 in Boise, Idaho, with the aim of giving the Treasure Valley broader access to orthopedic, sport bracing, and post-operative recovery resources. The company began as a local supplier focused on patient needs and has since extended its reach to collaborate with physicians across Idaho and Utah.

