UPDATE companies SET description='AutohausAZ traces its roots to 1979 when it opened as Autohaus Phoenix in Phoenix, Arizona, supplying European auto parts to local repair shops. The business launched its online store in 2000 and has since grown into a nationwide distributor with multiple warehouses serving hundreds of thousands of customers worldwide.

The company stocks a broad range of OEM and OE-quality replacement parts for European vehicles, covering brands such as BMW, Mercedes-Benz, Volvo, Porsche, Audi, Volkswagen, Saab, Land Rover, and Mercedes Sprinter. Its catalog includes components from air filters and brake rotors to engine mounts and transmission fluids, all maintained by a team of specialists who verify fitment by year, make, model, and submodel. Orders placed before 2 PM MST ship the same day from the nearest warehouse, and the company backs every part with a three-year, 36-month warranty.

AutohausAZ serves both do-it-yourself enthusiasts and professional repair shops, offering discounted pricing that the company says runs 20 to 90 percent below retail and wholesale levels.

The business was founded to fill a gap in the Phoenix market for reliable European auto parts, and it continues to emphasize direct sourcing, low markups, and a fitment-first catalog as its primary differentiators. A financing option allows buyers to spread the cost of unexpected repairs over time.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Same-day shipping", "Expedited shipping", "Customer service", "Parts fitment verification", "Online catalog management", "Financing options", "Returns processing", "Warranty administration"], "industries": ["Automotive aftermarket", "European vehicle parts distribution", "Auto repair shops", "Do-it-yourself automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day shipping for orders placed before 2 PM MST", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Same-day shipping on orders placed before 2 PM MST", "Three-year/36-month warranty on every part sold", "OEM and OE-quality parts sourced directly from manufacturers", "Nationwide warehouse network for fastest delivery", "Fitment-verified catalog maintained by in-house specialists"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1979 as Autohaus Phoenix in Phoenix, Arizona -> /about-us", "Online sales since 2000 -> db", "Nationwide warehouse network -> /about-us", "Same-day shipping for orders before 2 PM MST -> /", "3-year/36-month warranty on all parts -> /", "Carries OEM/OE-quality parts for BMW, Mercedes, Volvo, Porsche, Audi, VW, Saab, Land Rover, Sprinter -> /", "Serves DIYers and professional mechanics -> /about-us", "Offers financing on car parts -> /", "Fitment-verified catalog maintained by specialists -> /"], "company_type": "Distributor / reseller", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "AutohausAZ began in 1979 as Autohaus Phoenix, providing European auto parts to local repair shops in the Phoenix, Arizona area.", "founded_year": "1979", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "