UPDATE companies SET description='Founded in 1981 in Baltimore, Maryland, Avalon Industries remains a family-owned company organized around two distinct divisions. The business was established to manufacture protective carrying solutions and has grown to include a full-service promotional products operation.

The core manufacturing division produces soft-sided carrying cases, bags, totes, and molded laminate cases engineered to hold and transport supplies and equipment for commercial and military use. The second division, Avalon Promotional Products, operates as an advertising specialties distributor, providing personalized apparel, uniforms, and branded merchandise for brand identification and promotion campaigns.

For several years, both divisions have supplied the U.S. defense department, first-responder organizations, school systems, municipal governments, youth sports leagues, and a broad commercial client base. The manufacturer focuses on durable sewn and laminated case goods, while the promotional arm handles decoration, sourcing, and distribution of logoed apparel and merchandise.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Soft-sided carrying case manufacturing", "Bag and tote manufacturing", "Molded laminate case manufacturing", "Promotional product distribution", "Personalized apparel sourcing and distribution", "Uniform and merchandise distribution"], "industries": ["Defense", "First responders", "Education", "Government", "Youth sports", "Commercial"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1981 -> db", "Family-owned -> /", "Headquartered in Baltimore, Maryland -> db", "Two divisions: manufacturing and promotional products -> /", "Manufactures soft-sided carrying cases, bags, totes, molded laminate cases -> /", "Promotional products division distributes personalized apparel, uniforms, merchandise -> /", "Customers include defense department, first responders, schools, municipalities, youth sports leagues, commercial marketplace -> /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Avalon Industries\n1)\nsoft sided carrying cases\n2)\nBags, totes and molded laminate cases to hold and transport supplies and equipment for commercial and military applications", "founded_year": "1981", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": ["Family-owned"]}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='avalon-industries' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Avon Food Company operates from a 55,000-square-foot facility in Stoughton, Massachusetts. The business was founded in 2002 by Stephen and Heidee Anastos as a small family-run operation focused on sauces, dressings, and marinades. Today, the company is led by their son, Michael Anastos, who has expanded the operation while maintaining its family-owned character.

The company produces liquid and dry food products including sauces, dressings, marinades, and custom spice blends. Its SQF-certified facility houses four dedicated production lines: an electromagnetic filler for high-speed liquid filling, pressure overflow and piston fillers for varied viscosities, an auger filler for dry spices, and a line for 5-gallon pail and bag-in-box packaging. With a team of 35-plus employees, Avon handles everything from research and development and custom formulation to private-label manufacturing, storage, and delivery, producing more than 300 distinct items for clients ranging from startups to established brands.

Avon serves food brands and private-label partners across North America, offering nationwide shipping and regional delivery from its Massachusetts base. Its customer base includes both emerging companies seeking recipe development and scale-up support and larger brands requiring consistent, high-volume co-packing. The company''s in-house R&D team assists with flavor testing, ingredient sourcing, and scalability assessments to bring concepts to market-ready products.

Avon emphasizes its family-owned, next-generation leadership as a differentiator, combining heritage with investments in automation and technology. The company cites its SQF and HACCP compliance, allergen management, and traceability programs as the foundation of its quality assurance, while highlighting a partnership-first approach that treats each brand with the same care as its own.', certifications=ARRAY['HACCP','SQF']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Research & Development", "Custom formulation", "Flavor testing", "Ingredient sourcing", "Scalability assessment", "Liquid manufacturing", "Spice blending", "Private label manufacturing", "Hot & cold fill capabilities", "Electromagnetic filling", "Pressure overflow filling", "Piston filling", "Auger filling", "5-gallon pail filling", "Bag-in-box packaging", "Storage & delivery", "Quality & compliance", "Allergen management", "Traceability programs"], "industries": ["Food manufacturing", "Private label food", "Sauces", "Dressings", "Marinades", "Spice blends", "Specialty foods"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Electromagnetic filler", "Pressure overflow filler", "Piston filler", "Auger filler", "5-gallon pail filler", "Bag-in-box packaging equipment"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["SQF-certified facility with HACCP compliance", "Four specialized production lines (electromagnetic, pressure overflow/piston, auger, pail/bag-in-box)", "In-house R&D for custom formulation and flavor testing", "Nationwide shipping and flexible pickup options", "Family-owned, next-generation leadership"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2002 by Stephen and Heidee Anastos -> /about-us", "Led by son Michael Anastos -> /about-us", "55,000-square-foot SQF-certified facility in Stoughton, MA -> /about-us", "35+ employees -> /", "300+ items produced -> /", "Family-owned, next-generation leadership -> /, /about-us", "Four production lines with specialized fillers (electromagnetic, pressure overflow/piston, auger, p