UPDATE companies SET description='Axiom Manufacturing is based in Richardson, Texas, and has been producing electronics in the United States since 1992.

The company provides printed circuit board assembly (surface-mount and through-hole with automated optical inspection), custom RF circuit design and integration up to 40 GHz, full box-build and electromechanical assembly, cable and harness fabrication, and a suite of environmental, functional, and reliability testing to military standards. Axiom reports more than one million units delivered to over 500 customers with a 98 percent on-time delivery rate across three decades of operation.

Its customer base spans aerospace and defense (mission-critical systems for aviation, space, and defense), industrial (ruggedized electronics for harsh environments), medical (FDA-compliant devices and diagnostic equipment), and telecommunications (high-frequency RF solutions for wireless infrastructure).

Axiom states that its differentiation lies in delivering mission-critical electronic assemblies and RF solutions with unmatched reliability and precision, backed by domestic manufacturing since 1992 and testing protocols aligned with military requirements.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["PCB assembly (surface mount)", "PCB assembly (through-hole)", "Automated optical inspection", "RF circuit design", "Schematic capture", "PCB layout", "RF testing and integration (up to 40 GHz)", "Box build assembly", "Electromechanical assembly", "Cable and harness assembly", "Environmental testing", "Functional testing", "Reliability testing", "Engineering services"], "industries": ["Aerospace & Defense", "Industrial", "Medical", "Telecommunications"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Made in USA since 1992", "98% on-time delivery rate", "RF engineering up to 40 GHz", "FDA-compliant medical manufacturing", "Testing to military standards"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Richardson, Texas -> page ''/''", "Founded: 1992 -> page ''/'' (PROUDLY MADE IN USA SINCE 1992)", "Capabilities: PCB assembly, RF engineering, box build, cable & harness -> page ''/'' and db description", "Industries served: Aerospace & Defense, Industrial, Medical, Telecom -> page ''/''", "Scale: 1M+ units delivered, 500+ customers, 98% on-time delivery, 30+ years in business -> page ''/''", "RF engineering up to 40 GHz -> page ''/''", "FDA-compliant medical manufacturing -> page ''/''", "Testing to military standards -> page ''/''", "Company type: Manufacturer -> page ''/'' (Precision Electronics Manufacturing)", "Website: axman.com -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "Precision Electronics Manufacturing & Engineering Services", "founded_year": "1992", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownersh