UPDATE companies SET description='B & M Sheet Metal Shop, Inc. has been a family-owned fixture in Roanoke, Virginia since 1955. The business was founded by Wallace Leedy Martin, Edith Martin, and Marion Bartley, then led for decades by Wallace Lee Martin before passing to the current owner, Luke McVey Martin.

