UPDATE companies SET description='BG Southern Nevada, headquartered in North Las Vegas, Nevada, operates as a distributor for BG Products, Inc., a company founded in 1971 in Wichita, Kansas, by seven World War II veterans—John Thompson, Sam Parks, Don Walton, O.J. Connell, Q.T. Williams, Don Broadbent—and land-speed record holder Roy Leslie. The founders pooled their automotive industry experience to create a supplier of premium maintenance products sold through independent distributors.

