UPDATE companies SET description='Backyard Adventures Iowa opened in 2002 in Urbandale, Iowa, as a family recreation store serving customers across the state. The business was established with a focus on providing a local showroom where families could explore outdoor play equipment in person.

The company operates a showroom that carries playsets and swing sets from Backyard Adventures, basketball hoops from Goalsetter, and pergolas and gazebos from Backyard Discovery, along with outdoor furniture and patio accessories. The product lineup includes multiple series such as the Outlook, Summit, Treehouse, and Peak playset lines, as well as Goalsetter Signature and Extreme hoop series.

Its customer base consists primarily of Iowa homeowners and families looking for backyard recreation equipment. The store markets itself to the entire state, emphasizing a hands-on showroom experience where buyers can view and compare products before purchase. The company also directs outdoor furniture shoppers to its affiliated Okoboji Outdoor Living location, which shares the same staff and facility.

Since its founding, the company has highlighted family-oriented customer service as its defining priority, a commitment it says has guided its approach from the start. Seasonal promotions, such as fall discounts on playsets and hoops with bundled installation pricing, are used to attract buyers, but the core differentiator remains the emphasis on personal service.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Retail sales of outdoor playsets, basketball hoops, pergolas, gazebos, and outdoor furniture", "Installation services for playsets and basketball hoops", "Customer service and product consultation"], "industries": [], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": [], "facts_used": ["Founded in 2002 -> /", "Headquarters in Urbandale, Iowa -> db", "Retail showroom with Backyard Adventures, Goalsetter, Backyard Discovery products -> /", "Installation services available in metro area -> /", "Family & Customer Service stated as top priorities -> /", "Affiliated Okoboji Outdoor Living location mentioned -> /"], "company_type": "Retailer", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "Come visit us at Backyard Adventures of Iowa Family Recreation Store. We serve the whole state of Iowa and our highest priority is providing the best customer service for you and your family. In our showroom you will find Backyard Adventures Play Sets and Swing Sets, Goalsetter Basketball Hoops, and Outdoor Furniture and Patio Accessories.", "founded_year": "2002", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='backyard-adventures-iowa' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
UPDATE companies SET description='Bad Idea Factory operates a custom woodworking and design workshop in Grand Rapids, Michigan. The company focuses on wood gifts, custom furniture, signs, and related products, combining traditional craftsmanship with a 5-foot by 10-foot CNC machine, a woodshop, a welding lab, and a 3D printing lab.

The shop’s capabilities center on CNC cutting and engraving across a range of materials, supplemented by woodworking, welding, and additive manufacturing. It produces custom furniture such as kitchen tables, wine racks, and outdoor seating; charcuterie and cutting boards in standard or custom designs; and engraved signs and plaques, with the capacity to mass-produce smaller items or fabricate pieces larger than the CNC bed through multi-step processing.

The company serves customers seeking one-off custom pieces or batch-produced items, including individuals, gift buyers, and businesses needing signage. Examples from its service list include personalized charcuterie boards, custom furniture with specific dimensions and finishes, and engraved plaques for commemorative or branding purposes.

